%N A038287 Triangle whose (i,j)-th entry is binomial(i,j)*8^(i-j)*9^j.
%H A038287 B. N. Cyvin, J. Brunvoll, and S. J. Cyvin, <a href="http://match.pmf.kg.ac.rs/electronic_versions/Match34/match34_109-121.pdf">Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons</a>, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), 109-121.
%F A038287 T(n,k) = 9*T(n-1,k-1) + 8*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Sep 22 2026
%e A038287 Triangle begins as:
